# Replit Clone: Online Lab Platform - Complete Project SOP

## 1. Project Overview

**What is it?**
An online coding lab platform for college students. Students log in, create projects from templates (React, Node, Python, C++), write code in a browser-based IDE with a file tree and terminal, and get real-time preview of their work. Designed for coursework, DevOps labs, web dev assignments, and system programming practices.

**Why built this way?**
- Single medium EC2 instance running K3s (lightweight Kubernetes)
- Each student's project runs in an isolated pod with resource limits
- No managed AWS services (no ALB, Route53, ECR, CloudWatch) — cost-conscious MVP
- Students can't break other students' work or the main system

