## 5. Database Schema Purpose (Why Each Table)

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `users` | Core user records (email, hashed password, role) |
| `user_sessions` | Session/token tracking (access token, refresh token, expiry, revocation) |
| `project_templates` | Starter kits (React, Node, Python) with S3 template prefix |
| `projects` | User's actual projects, linked to template and environment |
| `environments` | Workspace state machine (created→starting→running→stopped) |
| `workspace_deployment` | K8s Deployment config snapshot (image, replicas, container port) |
| `workspace_services` | K8s Service config (port, cluster IP, deployment reference) |
| `workspace_ingresses` | K8s Ingress config (TLS, certificate secret) |
| `ingress_rules` | Routing rules (host, path, service mapping) |

