## 9. Workflow Timeline (8 Weeks)

**Week 1**: EC2 + K3s + PostgreSQL setup  
**Week 2**: Go backend auth endpoints (register, login, refresh, logout)  
**Week 3**: S3 integration, file CRUD, JWT middleware  
**Week 4**: K8s client-go integration (environment create/start/stop/delete)  
**Week 5**: WebSocket terminal gateway, kubectl exec integration  
**Week 6**: Docker build pipeline, image registry, Ingress URL generation  
**Week 7**: Pod security policies, NetworkPolicy, ResourceQuota, TLS  
**Week 8**: React frontend, GitHub Actions CI/CD, demo-ready  

