## 10. Common Operations (Troubleshooting)

| Issue | Investigation |
|-------|---|
| Can't login | Check `users` table, verify password hash, check session expiry in `user_sessions` |
| Files not showing | Check S3 credentials, verify S3 prefix in `projects` table matches objects |
| Environment won't start | Check K3s API, node capacity, pod logs via `kubectl logs` |
| Terminal not responding | Check WebSocket connection, verify pod still running, check kubectl exec permissions |
| Slow file upload | S3 multipart upload limits, check EBS IOPS burst |

